# Backend build context exclusions — keep the image lean and secret-free.
.git
.gitignore
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
venv
.venv
**/venv
tests
**/tests
docs
**/docs
dist
**/dist
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.md
!README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
